A Gantt chart displays a project schedule as horizontal bars on a timeline, grouping tasks into sections and showing durations, dependencies, and progress status. Use it for project planning, sprint schedules, and release timelines. Uses `gantt`.

---

!! Basic example

```
gantt
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD
    title Project schedule
    section Planning
    Define scope     :done, a1, 2024-01-08, 5d
    Research         :active, a2, after a1, 7d
    section Execution
    Implementation   :b1, after a2, 14d
    Testing          :b2, after b1, 5d
```

